  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:300px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkgreen pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Ghost Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/LuigiSucks.png/revision/latest?cb=20250428000308\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"LuigiSucks\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/LuigiSucks.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20250428000308\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/LuigiSucks.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20250428000308 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/LuigiSucks.png/revision/latest?cb=20250428000308 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"LuigiSucks\" width=\"270\" height=\"352\" data-image-key=\"LuigiSucks.png\" data-image-name=\"LuigiSucks.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Poltergust 5000 (Luigi's Manision) is capable of absorbing various types of ghosts by sucking them up.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb ghosts.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb ghosts and utilize them in some way</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Phantasm_Manipulation\" title=\"Phantasm Manipulation\">Phantasm Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Ghost_Catching_Mastery\" title=\"Ghost Catching Mastery\">Ghost Catching Mastery</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGhost_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Apparition Absorption/Siphon/Drain/Draining</li>\n<li>Ghost Siphon/Drain/Draining</li>\n<li>Phantom Absorption/Siphon/Drain/Draining</li>\n<li>Specter Absorption/Siphon/Drain/Draining</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGhost_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb ghosts, while removing them from the source, into their body and use them in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, trapping them, using them as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGhost_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ghost_Consumption\" title=\"Ghost Consumption\">Ghost Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGhost_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Trapping\" title=\"Astral Trapping\">Astral Trapping</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ectoplasm_Generation\" title=\"Ectoplasm Generation\">Ectoplasm Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ectoplasm_Infusion\" title=\"Ectoplasm Infusion\">Ectoplasm Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ectoplasm_Manipulation\" title=\"Ectoplasm Manipulation\">Ectoplasm Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ectoplasm_Mimicry\" title=\"Ectoplasm Mimicry\">Ectoplasm Mimicry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Negation\" title=\"Energy Negation\">Energy Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Manipulation\" title=\"Soul Manipulation\">Soul Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGhost_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Can't absorb self-generated ghosts.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how many ghosts one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May only be able to absorb certain types of ghosts.</li>\n<li>Users may be effected by the ghosts they absorb, effecting them either on a physical, mental, or even spiritual level.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be constantly active.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGhost_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://dannyphantom.fandom.com/wiki/Fenton_Thermos\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dannyphantom:Fenton Thermos\">Fenton Thermos</a> (<i>Danny Phantom</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ghostbusters.fandom.com/wiki/Trap\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ghostbusters:Trap\">Ghost Trap</a> (<i>Ghostbusters</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://luigi-mansion.fandom.com/wiki/Poltergust_5000\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:luigi-mansion:Poltergust 5000\">Poltergust 5000</a> (<i>Luigi's Manision</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260803191635\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 105/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 146/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.345      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%   16.345      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:554733-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260803191635 and revision id 2635317. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
